{hook_com[unstaged]} Q:${hook_com[quilt]} R:${hook_com[base]} S:${hook_com[subdir]}\n\t\t\tmsgs[$i]=${msg} \n\t\telse\n\t\t\tmsgs[$i]=${hook_com[message]} \n\t\tfi\n\tdone\n\thook_com=() \n\tbackend_misc=() \n\treturn 0' 
