[@]}" : \\\n\'*-r+[Install all packages listed in the given \\`requirements.txt\\` or \\`pylock.toml\\` files]:REQUIREMENTS:_files\' \\\n\'*--requirements=[Install all packages listed in the given \\`requirements.txt\\` or \\`pylock.toml\\` files]:REQUIREMENTS:_files\' \\\n\'*-e+[Install the editable package based on the provided local file path]:EDITABLE:_default\' \\\n\'*--editable=[Install the editable package based on the provided local file path]:EDITABLE:_default\' \\\n\'*-c+[Constrain versions using the given requirements files]:CONSTRAINTS:_default\' \\\n\'*--constraints=[Constrain versions using the given requirements files]:CONSTRAINTS:_default\' \\\n\'*--overrides=[Override versions using the given requirements files]:OVERRIDES:_default\' \\\n\'*-b+[Constrain build dependencies using the given requirements files when building source distributions]:BUILD_CONSTRAINTS:_default\' \\\n\'*--build-constraints=[Constrain build dependencies using the given requirements files when building source distributions]:BUILD_CONSTRAINTS:_default\' \\\n\'(--all-extras)*--extra=[Include optional dependencies from the specified extra name; may be provided more than once]:EXTRA:_default\' \\\n\'*--index=[The URLs to use when resolving dependencies, in addition to the default index]:INDEX:_default\' \\\n\'--default-index=[The URL of the default package index (by default\\: <https\\://pypi.org/simple>)]:DEFAULT_INDEX:_default\' \\\n\'-i+[(Deprecated\\: use \\`--default-index\\` instead) The URL of the Python package index (by default\\: <https\\://pypi.org/simple>)]:INDEX_URL:_default\' \\\n\'--index-url=[(Deprecated\\: use \\`--default-index\\` instead) The URL of the Python package index (by default\\: <https\\://pypi.org/simple>)]:INDEX_URL:_default\' \\\n\'*--extra-index-url=[(Deprecated\\: use \\`--index\\` instead) Extra URLs of package indexes to use, in addition to \\`--index-url\\`]:EXTRA_INDEX_URL:_default\' \\\n\'*-f+[Locations to search for candidate distributions, i